Title: Agentic Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Knowledge-Intensive Tasks
Authors: Minh Nguyen, Hoang Le
Categories: Artificial Intelligence, Information Retrieval
Summary: Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) significantly improves large language model accuracy by grounding responses in retrieved passages. We explore agentic multi-hop reasoning and routing across heterogeneous vector indices.ÿÿ